			"text": "Condenser plates =\nparallel-plate\ncapacitor (old word\n'condenser' =\ncapacitor). ±high\nvoltage gives a\nuniform E field that\ndeflects ions\nsideways. It does NOT\n'condense' or focus\nanything",
